        "original_id": "98e136c1-536d-5a40-8e1a-04403b50f34a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Reels, Creedence Clearwater Revival\n- Songs: \"This Guy's in Love With You\", \"Bad Moon Rising\", \"After the News\"\n- Albums: \"Quasimodo's Dream\"\n- Charts: Australian Kent Music Report Singles Chart\n\nFacts:\n- Creedence Clearwater Revival was an American rock band active in the late 1960s and early 1970s.\n- \"After the News\" was a song by The Reels that was released in July 1980 as a single from their second album \"Quasimodo's Dream\".\n- The Reels reached No. 7 on the Australian Kent Music Report Singles Chart in 1982 with their cover of Herb Alpert's \"This Guy's in Love With You\".\n- The Reels reached No. 11 on the Australian Kent Music Report Singles Chart in 1986 with their cover of Creedence Clearwater Revival's \"Bad Moon Rising\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
